{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">香港小姐2026八強名單出爐！《2026香港小姐競選決賽》於今（30日）晚8時TVB翡翠台現場直播！香港小姐2026八強佳麗分別是1號袁絲珩Bernice、2號李澤欣Scarlett、5號魏欣Etherine、6號盧蔚晴Jasmine、7號楊媛媛Vera 、8號鄧匡閔Ada 、10號陳梓穎Cecilia、11號顏懿菲Agnes，3號李澄晴Chorie奪「友誼小姐」。</span><br/><br/></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a8817d0b-8a23-446b-805b-ed587a62651d.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026LtMAgqD6N71788097656.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a8817d0b-8a23-446b-805b-ed587a62651d.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T14:18:32.221565+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}